    <summary>The Power User's Windows Optimization Platform</summary>
    <description>
Win-Debloat is a modern, modular, and safe Windows debloating and optimization framework designed for PowerShell 7.6+.

### Features
* **Debloat**: Remove pre-installed bloatware safely with O(N) regex precision.
* **Privacy Score**: 11-vector 100-point privacy scoring engine with graded analysis.
* **AI Neutralization**: Neutralize Windows Recall (v2), Copilot, and reclaim 2.0-4.5 GB RAM from AI Fabric.
* **Enterprise Security**: Windows Protected Print (RFC 8011), Sudo Isolation, and BitLocker XTS-256.
* **Performance & Gaming**: AMD X3D Core Parking safeguards, Intel Thread Director, DirectStorage 1.2, and TCP CUBIC/BBR2.
* **GUI/TUI**: Choose between a Cyberpunk 24-bit TrueColor TUI or a high-DPI WPF Cockpit GUI.
* **Snapshots**: DPAPI-encrypted snapshots for 100% symmetric system rollback.

**Note**: This package installs the "Standard" edition.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/tomytate/Win-Debloat/releases</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="powershell-core" version="7.6.0" />
    </dependencies>
